 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 5 – 6 use the scenario below:</p>\n<blockquote>\nA car traveled 180 miles at a constant rate.</blockquote><br>\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"5\">\n  <li>For each of the missing spaces in the table, a-d, select the missing value that completes the table to show the rate at which the car was traveling if it completed the same distance in each number of hours.</li>\n</ol>\n<table class=\"unnumbered os-raise-skinnytable\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Travel Time<br>(Hours)</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Rate of Travel<br>(Miles Per Hour)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>5</td>\n      <td>a. ____ <br></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>4.5</td>\n      <td>b. ____ <br></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>c. ____</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2.25</td>\n      <td>d. ____</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
